$ trilium branch add script1 root
cloned script1 into root (branch root_script1)

$ trilium rm meeting1
stderr| error: meeting1 "Meeting notes" has 1 child; use -r to delete them too
stderr| hint: add -r to delete the whole subtree
exit: 2

$ trilium rm meeting1 -r
deleted meeting1 "Meeting notes" (+1 child; undo: trilium undelete meeting1)

$ trilium rm script1
deleted script1 "Script.py" (undo: trilium undelete script1) (was in 2 places; to remove one placement use: trilium branch rm)

$ trilium rm root
stderr| error: refusing to delete root: it is a Trilium system note
exit: 2

$ trilium rm _hidden
stderr| error: refusing to delete _hidden: it is a Trilium system note
exit: 2

$ trilium rm projects1 missing1 -r
stderr| error: Note 'missing1' not found. [NOTE_NOT_FOUND]
stderr| hint: find note IDs with: trilium search <words>
exit: 3

$ trilium undelete meeting1
restored meeting1 "Meeting notes"

$ trilium ls projects1
meeting1	text	Meeting notes	+1
old1	text	Old	(archived)

